#X msg 130 1445 samp_interval;
#X text 270 1445 sets sampling interval - how often analog data and
i2c data is reported to the client. The default for the arduino implementation
is 19ms. This means that every 19ms analog data will be reported and
any i2c devices with read continuous mode will be read. Аргументы:;
#X obj 300 1530 cnv 1 38 21 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -245695 -1 0;
#X text 300 1530 TIME: time. Тип: int. Диапазон: 10…10000\. Единицы:
'ms'.;
